# E2E test credentials
#
# The suite signs in to a real account and writes rows to the database, so it
# needs a throwaway account. Never point this at an account with data you care
# about: cleanup removes rows whose description contains the marker, which is
# "e2e-test", but tests do also read totals.
#
# Create the account, then confirm the email. The Supabase free tier caps
# outbound email, so confirming via a dashboard link is easier than waiting for
# one.
#
# The account needs at least two accounts (Cash and Bank) for the transfer test.
# Sign-up provisioning creates Cash; add Bank in the UI.

E2E_EMAIL=e2e@example.com
E2E_PASSWORD=ChangeMe123!

# Overridden by playwright.config.ts when unset.
E2E_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Marker used to identify rows this suite created. Cleanup matches on it.
E2E_MARKER=e2e-test